Definition

Session Memory means remembering information only during the current chat session.

When the chat ends or the session expires, the memory is usually cleared.

Example

User:

My favorite language is Python.

Later in the same chat:

User:

Which language do I like?

AI:

Python.

The AI remembers it because it is stored in session memory.

Simple Definition

Session Memory stores important information during the current conversation so the AI can answer consistently.
